        <mxCell id="panel" value="&lt;b&gt;Entscheidungen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Erreichbarkeit: &lt;b&gt;private&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Netzwerk: create, 10.20.0.0/16&lt;br&gt;Private DNS: deployment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;Offen&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which subscriptions do the development, test and production stages deploy into? The request named staging&amp;apos;s only; the stack is one subscription per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which resource group does each of the other stages deploy into?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which address ranges are assigned to the development, test and production networks? Staging&amp;apos;s is 10.20.0.0/16; the others cannot overlap it.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: network / IPAM owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which prefix out of each stage&amp;apos;s range carries its private endpoints?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: network / IPAM owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Follows deployment.address_space per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: network / IPAM owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Each stage&amp;apos;s subnets follow its range; the app subnet keeps its name and size.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: network / IPAM owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Follows deployment.private_endpoint_subnet_prefix per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: network / IPAM owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which tag set does the organisation apply? Nothing in the request, no repository to read it from.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: workload owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which principal writes and reads the raw data, and which data-plane role does it need? Shared-key auth is off, so an account with no assignment is working as specified and unusable.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: workload owner)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#C8C6C4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
